  "description": "On the first night, the master's bride disappeared. In the princess's now empty bedroom, the master commanded Evely, who was at a loss: \"You will take the princess's place.\" It began as a half-joke, but the maid's impudence, fearful yet unflinching, aroused his cruel instincts.\n\n *\"My, my lord.\"\n\n\"Yes. I am your master. So, Stick your tongue out.*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
